  "description": "Yu-Kyung Han, once a gifted ballerino, had his dreams shattered by an accident. Five years later, his world falls apart once more when his partner, Shi-Yoon, admits to cheating, a pregnancy, and a shotgun engagement. Heartbroken and spiraling, Yu-Kyung turns to risky casual sex and encounters Do-Jin, an old classmate with a faded crush. Do-Jin introduces him to BDSM with the promise of distracting Yu-Kyung from his ex. Can this complicated new connection offer him a new beginning? \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Chapter count includes 3 side stories.*",
